WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.000
Turn any SVG

00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:02.732
into a spinning

00:00:02.543 --> 00:00:03.368
gold coin

00:00:03.894 --> 00:00:04.719
Minted is a

00:00:04.531 --> 00:00:07.066
free MIT-licensed SwiftUI

00:00:06.877 --> 00:00:08.162
component that turns

00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:09.518
SVG artwork into

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.474
a three-dimensional

00:00:10.285 --> 00:00:11.087
gold medal

00:00:11.276 --> 00:00:12.136
built for things

00:00:11.948 --> 00:00:13.398
like achievement badges

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:14.695
and commemorative coins

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.275
It offers four

00:00:16.087 --> 00:00:17.195
coin shapes can

00:00:17.006 --> 00:00:18.386
engrave text and

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:19.129
can even make

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.202
coins from images

00:00:20.341 --> 00:00:21.013
You do not

00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:21.685
need to prepare

00:00:21.544 --> 00:00:22.569
any 3D model

00:00:22.381 --> 00:00:23.029
at all

00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:25.126
Geometry is generated

00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:25.833
from your 2D

00:00:25.645 --> 00:00:27.083
paths with enamel

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:27.591
inlays

00:00:27.685 --> 00:00:28.935
studio reflections

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:29.560
and spins

00:00:29.608 --> 00:00:30.279
so your app

00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:31.258
ships zero model

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:31.718
files

00:00:32.238 --> 00:00:33.252
Full story on

00:00:33.063 --> 00:00:33.959
the dashboard
